2. COMMERCIAL DEPLOYMENT & 10% REVENUE SHARE COVENANT
================================================================================
Any individual, entity, company, or organization that utilizes, deploys,
embeds, white-labels, or operates the Software (or any derivative work thereof)
as a commercial product, SaaS platform, paid service, telephony agency, or
revenue-generating business ("Commercial User") agrees to the following binding
covenant:

a. Revenue Sharing Obligation:
   The Commercial User shall pay to the Licensor (Voice Force / 180 Workspace)
   a royalty of ten percent (10%) of all gross revenues ("Gross Revenue")
   generated directly or indirectly through the provision, subscription, resale,
   or deployment of services powered by the Software.

b. Gross Revenue Definition:
   Gross Revenue includes, without limitation:
   - Monthly or annual software subscription fees (SaaS).
   - Per-minute telephony, telecommunications, or voice synthesis surcharges.
   - Platform setup, onboarding, integration, or custom agent provisioning fees.
   - API access, webhook processing, or usage-based billing fees.
   - Agency retainer or management fees derived from managing voice agents.

c. Reporting & Remittance:
   - Commercial Users must register their commercial deployment by emailing
     partners@vanityworkspace.com or registering via the partner portal.
   - Royalties shall be calculated and remitted on a monthly calendar basis
     within thirty (30) days following the end of each calendar month.
   - The Licensor reserves the right to request reasonable third-party accounting
     or payment gateway statements (e.g., Stripe/Razorpay) verifying reported
     telephony and subscription revenues.

d. Failure to Remit:
   Failure to report or remit the required 10% revenue share within sixty (60)
   days of due date automatically revokes the Commercial User's license to
   utilize, operate, update, or deploy the Software for commercial purposes.

For full terms, exemptions, enterprise licensing, or questions, please refer to
COMMERCIAL_TERMS.md or contact: legal@vanityworkspace.com / partners@vanityworkspace.com
